# Formiqo MVP Harness

This repo uses a **static multi-agent harness** to deliver [`docs/PRD.md`](docs/PRD.md).

## Before multi-epic or gate work

1. [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) — roles and governance
2. [`harness/OPERATING-MODEL.md`](harness/OPERATING-MODEL.md) — gates and pipeline
3. [`harness/sprints/CURRENT`](harness/sprints/CURRENT) — active backlog
4. [`harness/gates/`](harness/gates/) — stop-the-line status

## Commands

- **`/run-mvp`** — autonomous conductor to MVP ship (sit and wait)
- `/pm` — PM orchestration
- `/epic E1` — run one epic with correct role
- `/gate G1` — quality gate review
- `/sprint-plan` — sprint planning

## Rules

- **G1 APPROVED** before E1 implementation
- **G2 QA APPROVED** before E5
- **G3 APPROVED** before E6 live API integration
- **G4 QA APPROVED** before MVP ship
- Coordinate system: top-left pixel bboxes on 200 DPI PNGs (PRD §2.2)
